-- Graduation Fast batch 012: reviewed canonical entities and relations.
-- Generated by scripts/prepare-graduation-library-batch-002.mjs (GRADUATION_REVIEW_BATCH=fast-batch-012).
-- Scope: 3 new architects, 3 buildings, 3 images,
